  "description": "This game introduces a four-zone rhythm system that divides the screen into distinct areas.\nNotes travel from the edges toward the center—time your inputs perfectly to stay on beat.\nPlay with controller inputs or touchscreen controls and enjoy the game your way.\nThe mechanics are simple, using only single notes and simultaneous inputs, but achieving perfect accuracy takes skill.\n\nSet in a digital world, the story follows strange events unfolding within a social rhythm game.\nAvatars are stolen, mysterious entities appear, and unsettling messages begin to surface.\nThe story progresses through chat screens, with conversations gradually revealing what is really happening.\nBeyond the chat, the story continues—quietly, but inevitably.\n\nClimb the online leaderboards and aim for the ultimate score of 1,000,000 points.\nAn accessible yet demanding rhythm game designed for players who value precision.",
